translate schinese_rewrite Card_Game_Turn_0e4a2633:

    # coit "Did ye steal my remaining luck? How are ye winning against an experienced cardslinger like me."
    coit "你偷走了我剩下的好运吗？像我这种老练的牌手，你怎么赢得了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Card_Game_Turn_d6ca0a73:

    # fokk "What a load of bollocks. Blame it on the server! He's clearly cloudin' me judgment..."
    fokk "真是一派胡言。怪到侍者头上吧！他显然把我的判断力都搅乱了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Card_Game_Turn_073727d9:

    # gato "Bloody 'ell, last again? Yer all cheating little scoundrels dealing me such a weak hand."
    gato "见鬼，又是最后一名？你们这些作弊的小混蛋，给我的牌也太差了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Card_Game_Turn_1226dfc6:

    # coit "Bugger me boots, that's a total bullshit. I've never seen this shit deck before. Lemme shuffle the cards next game!"
    coit "踢我靴子，真是扯淡。我从没见过这么烂的牌堆。下一局让我来洗牌！"

translate schinese_rewrite Card_Game_Turn_25161131:

    # e "O-oh, did you all finished all your cards?"
    e "呃——你们是不是都把牌出完了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Card_Game_Turn_e4fb8f42:

    # "This round is finished."
    "这一轮结束了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_47599636:

    # o "Alright, let me show you guys how it's done."
    o "好吧，让我来给你们示范一下该怎么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_2deca3ff:

    # "Ole throws a disk forward..."
    "奥利把圆盘向前掷去……"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_257f6aa0:

    # "His disk steers off the path very quickly."
    "他的圆盘很快就偏离了路线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_3dec7a77:

    # o "Ok, wait. That wasn't the best demonstration."
    o "好，等等。这可算不上什么精彩示范。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_5a18f1f6:

    # "You can hear the wolf and the lion burst into loud laughter at the back, slapping their knees while pointing at Ole."
    "你能听见后面的狼和狮子突然爆发出震耳大笑，一边指着奥利，一边拍着膝盖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_11b20cac:

    # s "HAHah- Is this a demonstration of what not to do? I told you [e] he's really bad at this game."
    s "哈哈——这是在示范反面教材吗？我早就告诉过你了，[e]，他真的很不擅长这个游戏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_d97d3c8f:

    # l "Well-"
    l "好吧——"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_0306f383:

    # "Lothar can't hold onto his laughter, and chuckles for another few seconds again."
    "洛萨尔憋不住笑，又咯咯笑了好几秒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_dcacb924:

    # l "Even my grandfather could probably throw better than this lizard does."
    l "就连我爷爷恐怕都比这只蜥蜴扔得好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_6088e337:

    # o "Hands slipped."
    o "手滑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_1a922471:

    # o "Hey- I haven't played the game for a while, this is just a warm-up."
    o "嘿——我有段时间没玩这个了，这只是热身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_6b362615:

    # s "No warm up. We're drawing a zero onto the paper."
    s "不是什么热身。我们是在纸上画零分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_f490da98:

    # "Eventually you let out a slight grin, but at least Ole didn't feel bad about this."
    "你最终露出一丝笑意，不过至少奥利没有因此感到难过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_cf38d9be:

    # "He returns to stand by. And it's Lothar's turn."
    "他回到一旁站着。轮到洛萨尔了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_2cb72799:

    # "It's your turn now."
    "现在轮到你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_84eb3294:

    # s "Alright, now look at this."
    s "好吧，瞧瞧这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_5142a4d1:

    # "It's another round. and Ole prepares his disk."
    "又一轮开始了，奥利准备好他的圆盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_75e55a90:

    # o "Alright, let's see."
    o "好吧，让我看看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_115e6eb0:

    # "The wolf takes a beer from the table, and guzzling it down like it's water."
    "狼从桌上拿起一杯啤酒，像喝水一样一饮而尽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_d0c817d2:

    # l "Alright, let me show you how it's done."
    l "好吧，让我教你该怎么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_2cb72799_1:

    # "It's your turn now."
    "现在轮到你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_030a0018:

    # "Sebas takes a huge gulp of the beer, before putting it down and letting out a burp."
    "塞巴斯猛灌了一大口啤酒，放下后打了个嗝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_f8c3a22f:

    # s "I'm going to blow that stupid Lot away with this throw."
    s "我要用这一投把那个蠢洛特打飞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_bdf652ab:

    # "Ole walks up to the line, and throws his last disk."
    "奥利走到投掷线前，投出了最后一枚圆盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_902e53cc:

    # s "Well, it's your turn now, Lothar."
    s "好，现在轮到你了，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_820dd401:

    # l "Mhmm, I'm calibrating my aim, lion."
    l "嗯，我正在校准准头，狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_2cb72799_2:

    # "It's your turn now."
    "现在轮到你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Play_Disk_Game_dfec686a:

    # s "F-final throw, h-eh here I go..."
    s "最、最后一投，呃-呃，我来了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_766a7c60:

    # "He quite easily hits the center of the board."
    "他轻而易举地击中了圆盘中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_87c6d9a5:

    # s "See... that's what I call- skill."
    s "看吧……这就叫——技术。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_8e0a3893:

    # l "Ugh- That's not even close to the bull's eye."
    l "啧——离靶心还差得远呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_eb308ba2:

    # s "Ohhhh! I'm soooo good at this. Take note, Ole."
    s "哦——！我可真是太擅长这个了。记好了，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_a7ea4b21:

    # o "Note, taken."
    o "记下了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_d7d29f09:

    # "The lion misses the center by a slight margin, he instead gets a solid 3."
    "狮子稍微偏离了中心，最后稳稳拿了3分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_3479eb30:

    # s "Should be all good. I'm satisfied."
    s "应该没问题了。我很满意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_e86a2860:

    # e "It looked like it can hit a 5 easily."
    e "看起来本来很轻松就能拿到5分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_57986247:

    # s "Almost! If only the floor is a little bit more slippery."
    s "差一点！要是地板再滑一点就好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_b8658353:

    # l "It's going to slide right off like how your luck's gonna run out, lion."
    l "它会直接滑出去，就像你的好运也快用光了一样，狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_9ca804cc:

    # "Sebas gets [coolScore] as he fumbles the disk."
    "塞巴斯手忙脚乱地失手时，得到了[coolScore]分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_691c589a:

    # l "Ha, not even close, lion."
    l "哈，差得远呢，狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_ca002f3f:

    # s "Shut up, I know what I'm doing..."
    s "闭嘴，我知道自己在做什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_f5bfccfa:

    # o "Oh? Seb, you don't need to hold back. We know how well you can play."
    o "哦？塞巴斯，你不用有所保留。我们知道你有多会玩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_f0f29ae9:

    # s "O! Stop laughing!"
    s "奥利！别笑了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_014d786d:

    # "Sebas' disk seems to stray far away... you don't even know where it went."
    "塞巴斯的圆盘似乎偏到老远……你甚至不知道它跑哪儿去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_2c677a21:

    # o "Where's the disk?"
    o "圆盘呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_e37554e1:

    # e "I think it's right there. By that patron's foot."
    e "我想就在那儿。那位客人的脚边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_eb96b12c:

    # l "How embarrassing."
    l "真丢人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Aiming_Disk_a53dbce5:

    # s "Sh----uttt-tt Up! I've never missed before I swear."
    s "闭——嘴——！我发誓，我以前从没失手过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_91274233:

    # "Surprisingly, Ole's disk hits the center of the board."
    "出人意料的是，奥利的圆盘击中了靶盘中央。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_a49621c9:

    # o "Oh? Didn't even know how this game work."
    o "哦？我连这游戏怎么玩都不知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_4d818343:

    # s "That must not be blind luck... right?"
    s "那不可能只是瞎猫碰上死耗子……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_b4390a49:

    # e "Woah, nice throw, Ole!"
    e "哇，奥利，投得漂亮！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_0db5e103:

    # o "Haha, is this game always that easy?"
    o "哈哈，这游戏一直都这么简单吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_623f666b:

    # l "Hmmph... don't push your luck, lizard."
    l "哼……别得意忘形，蜥蜴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_47006159:

    # "The lizard gets 3 score for hitting near the bull's eye."
    "蜥蜴击中靶心附近，得了3分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_033a57aa:

    # o "Ah- That's something else."
    o "啊——这可真不一般。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_39077d5c:

    # s "Oh damn, that shot was actually quite good."
    s "我靠，那一投居然真的挺不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_79323078:

    # o "Is that a 3 or a 5. I feel it can be a 5."
    o "那是3分还是5分？我觉得可以算5分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_ac025c9c:

    # l "That's not even close to 5. But I'll give you props for getting a positive score."
    l "离5分还差得远呢。不过你至少拿到了正分，这点值得夸奖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_4db3681b:

    # "His disk goes wide open, scoring a [coolScore]."
    "他的圆盘大幅偏出，得了[coolScore]分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_44a744b3:

    # o "That's an improvement from the... demonstration."
    o "比起刚才那场……示范，已经进步了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_f93647ea:

    # s "Now this is the Ole I know."
    s "这才是我认识的奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_5feeb1fb:

    # o "I swear it was a good throw, but the disk just steers off for some reason..."
    o "我发誓我这次扔得很好，可飞盘不知怎么就偏了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_186683bb:

    # l "And we can safely assume the problem's not the disk."
    l "我们可以确信，问题不在飞盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_8292e63d:

    # "Ole misses again, completely."
    "奥利又一次彻底扔偏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_6664cb13:

    # s "OH MY L-ORD! He did it again! Look!"
    s "我的老——天！他又失手了！看！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_c3999bfd:

    # "Sebas gets so excited for a miss that he shakes the wolf's shoulder."
    "塞巴斯因为他又没扔中而兴奋不已，摇晃着狼人的肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_da5c0167:

    # l "Wh- Hahah- how are you soooo bad at throwing, lizard?"
    l "什——哈哈——你这蜥蜴，扔东西怎么能差成这样啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_09e6f55f:

    # l "Heheh... You missed the bull's eye by such a small margin, lizard."
    l "呵呵……蜥蜴，你就差那么一点点没扔中靶心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Aiming_Disk_6d73790d:

    # s "I-I can't... That's the worst throw I have ever seen!"
    s "我、我受不了了……这是我见过最差的一次投掷！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_2fb7148b:

    # "With a relative amount of ease, Lothar's disk hits the center."
    "洛萨尔的飞盘相当轻松地命中了中心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_1bd2c500:

    # l "Ha- That's right. That's what I'm talking about."
    l "哈——没错。就是这个意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_8991fb92:

    # s "T-that doesn't even count."
    s "这、这根本不算。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_ee9744db:

    # l "Cry more, lion."
    l "再哭大声点，狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_0c141eff:

    # o "That was a good shot, Lothar."
    o "那一投不错，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_3933f807:

    # l "What can I say, another proof that the hero's skill is unfathomably superior."
    l "还能说什么呢，这又一次证明了英雄的技艺高深莫测，远超常人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_c56d0974:

    # "The wolf's aim is slightly off the mark, only getting a 3."
    "狼人的准头稍微偏了些，只拿到了3分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_7ba38006:

    # l "Is this disk chipped or something, that bat must not be cleaning them more often."
    l "这飞盘是不是缺了个口？那只蝙蝠肯定没经常清理它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_14ec8644:

    # s "Hah- Now you're blaming the disk."
    s "哈——现在又怪飞盘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_1d468be7:

    # l "Ugh... Must have been the wind."
    l "呃……肯定是风的缘故。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_08b51111:

    # "Ole sneezes beside the defeated Lothar."
    "奥利在败下阵来的洛萨尔身旁打了个喷嚏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_c16fb960:

    # "Despite his boast, Lothar's disk steers off early on, only scoring a [coolScore]."
    "尽管夸下了海口，洛萨尔的飞盘一开始就偏了，只拿到[coolScore]分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_ed51e337:

    # l "How is the floor so tilted! This game is soooo fucking bad!"
    l "地板怎么会这么斜！这游戏真他妈烂透了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_350088b5:

    # e "I don't think it matters that much..."
    e "我觉得没那么严重……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_83b9126c:

    # l "Yes it does!"
    l "明明就有！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_cbbbdae1:

    # s "Ha- Where did it even go!"
    s "哈——它到底飞哪儿去了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_c283d42d:

    # l "Say that one more time and it'll go straight into your skull."
    l "再说一遍试试，它就会直接飞进你的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_9709c16d:

    # "Lothar's disk went for a completely different direction, it lands somewhere...."
    "洛萨尔的飞盘偏向了完全不同的方向，落在了某个地方……"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_11cc9716:

    # l "W-wait what. What just happened... Someone just cursed me."
    l "等、等等，什么情况？刚才发生了什么……有人诅咒我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_f764fc97:

    # s "Haha- And you laughed at Ole back then."
    s "哈哈——你刚才不也嘲笑奥利吗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_397bb6e7:

    # l "Someone touched my arm when I threw. That's wasn't where it's supposed to go!"
    l "我投出去的时候有人碰了我的手臂。它本来不该飞向那边的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_70caa2d2:

    # e "Are you sure? We're all back here."
    e "你确定吗？我们可都在后面呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Lothar_Aiming_Disk_c45e2e87:

    # l "Yes I'm fucking sure, disciple."
    l "我他妈当然确定，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_ad6e5193:

    # "Your disk slides easily into the bull's eye."
    "你的飞盘轻松滑进了靶心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_87adebfe:

    # s "W-wait, is this really your first time... That was actually good."
    s "等、等等，这真的是你第一次玩吗……刚才投得真不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_f8041063:

    # l "My disciple has his talent that's boundless to mere lion."
    l "我这徒弟的天赋，可不是区区雄狮能比的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_599ddf50:

    # o "That was a good throw, [e]."
    o "这一投不错，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_4e290f13:

    # e "I just happened to get it right this time."
    e "我只是碰巧投中了而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_686985af:

    # "The disk doesn't hit the center smoothly, but instead you score a solid 3."
    "飞盘没能顺利击中中心，而是稳稳拿下了3分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_b8299686:

    # e "Damn, it just touches the border."
    e "该死，就差一点，刚好擦到边缘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_930de757:

    # l "Almost there, that's why you still have something to learn from the best of the best."
    l "差一点就中了，所以你还得向真正顶尖的人多学学。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_822e6275:

    # s "It's pretty good already, I'm sure Ole doesn't get this close to the target."
    s "已经相当不错了，我敢肯定奥利可没法离目标这么近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_3cb9a848:

    # o "I'm also sure Seb's gonna regret saying that when he gets a lower score than I do."
    o "我也敢肯定，等塞巴斯的分数比我低时，他会后悔自己刚才那句话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_cde2ce9c:

    # s "Yeah, only in your dream."
    s "是啊，也就只能在你的梦里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_2a31f649:

    # "With the disk sliding far away from the bull's eye, you score a [coolScore]."
    "飞盘滑得离靶心老远，你得分为[coolScore]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_aa42fd44:

    # l "How did you miss that obvious angle right there! Disciple."
    l "这么明显的角度你怎么还能投偏！弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_cd07ec3b:

    # o "Hey, [e] is doing pretty well for a beginner, a [coolScore] is better than nothing."
    o "嘿，[e]作为新手已经表现得相当不错了，[coolScore]分总比一分没有强。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_df144ad1:

    # e "W-what happened? I swear i was aiming towards... somewhere else."
    e "怎、怎么回事？我发誓我瞄准的是……别的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_9918ed0e:

    # s "It was quite wide actually, I gotta practice with you more often!"
    s "其实偏得挺远的，我得多和你练习才行！"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_c4da9885:

    # "You miss the target, and it doesn't even seem to hit any lines."
    "你没打中目标，甚至看起来连任何一条线都没碰到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Player_Aiming_Disk_b1441da6:

    # s "Damn, didn't know you're as bad as Ole did, buddy!"
